    lead: "Make a peace sign and you smile. Make a fist and you look angry. In this tip, you build the system that changes your expression with hand gestures yourself, in the FX Animator. It covers the gesture numbers, which hand takes priority, how expressions overlap with blinking and mouth movement, and how to use grip strength.",
