      "VRChat turns your current hand gesture into a number and puts it in Int parameters called <code>GestureLeft</code> (left hand) and <code>GestureRight</code> (right hand). VRChat fills in both automatically. You don't need to add them to Expression Parameters, and VRChat sends them to other people too.",
