    clipsLead: `You make an expression by writing BlendShape values into an animation clip. How to make a clip (recording) is explained in ${tipLink("animation-clip", "record")}. Here are the rules to follow for expression clips.`,
    clips: [
      "In the Project window, make a folder for your expression clips (e.g. <code>Assets/MyGesture</code>). Right-click and choose <code>Create → Animation</code> to make clips with the names in the right column of the table (e.g. <code>Face_Smile</code>). Also make <code>Face_Neutral</code> for your normal face.",
