      "<strong>Write every BlendShape you use for expressions into every clip.</strong> In the smile clip, also write the BlendShapes for the angry and surprised faces, set to 0. On an avatar with Write Defaults OFF, a BlendShape that isn't in the clip keeps its previous value. If you write them all, you get the same expression whether Write Defaults is ON or OFF.",
      "Don't write BlendShapes that have nothing to do with expressions (shrinking the body, blush, hiding clothes and so on). If you do, your body shape will change too when you switch gestures. Press the record button again to stop recording.",
