      `<code>VRC Animator Tracking Control</code> prevents this. Add it to a state, and when the layer enters that state, it can stop VRChat's blinking or mouth movement (Animation) or bring it back (Tracking). <code>No Change</code> leaves the current setting alone. The setting stays until another state changes it again (${ext(links.behaviors, "VRChat's State Behaviors page")}).`,
