      "Select the <code>Animation</code> state, press <code>Add Behaviour</code> in the Inspector and choose <code>VRC Animator Tracking Control</code>. Set <code>Eyes &amp; Eyelids</code> to <code>Animation</code>. If your expressions also change the mouth shape, set <code>Mouth &amp; Jaw</code> to <code>Animation</code> too. Leave the other parts on <code>No Change</code>.",
