      "Select the <code>Face_Angry</code> state in the <code>Left Hand</code> layer and change its Motion to this clip. In the Inspector, check <code>Parameter</code> next to <code>Motion Time</code> and choose <code>GestureLeftWeight</code>.",
    ],
    weightNote: "Grip strength is sent to other people too, but not very often. To others, the change may look a little less smooth.",
    lockTitle: "Stopping expressions from the menu",
