    lock: [
      `Add a Bool called <code>GestureFaceOff</code> to Expression Parameters (check Saved and Synced, leave Default unchecked). Put a Toggle for this parameter in your menu. You add them the same way as in ${tipLink("toggle", "params")} and ${tipLink("toggle", "menu")}.`,
      "Also add <code>GestureFaceOff</code> as a Bool to the Animator's Parameters.",
      "In the <code>Left Hand</code> layer, select each transition to an expression other than Neutral, one by one, and add <code>GestureFaceOff</code>, <code>false</code> to its Conditions. This means \"only while expressions aren't stopped\".",
      "Draw one more transition from Any State to Neutral, with the condition <code>GestureFaceOff</code>, <code>true</code>. The moment you stop expressions, your face goes back to normal.",
      "Add the same conditions to the <code>Right Hand</code> and <code>Eyes Mouth</code> layers. In <code>Eyes Mouth</code>, add a transition that goes back to <code>Tracking</code> when <code>GestureFaceOff</code> is true.",
    ],
    testTitle: "Connect it to your avatar and test",
    test: [
      `Connect your Animator Controller to FX with Modular Avatar's MA Merge Animator. See ${tipLink("toggle", "connect")} for how.`,
