        cause: "The Neutral in the lower Right Hand layer writes every expression BlendShape as 0 and overwrites the left hand's expression.",
        fix: "Change the clip in Right Hand's Neutral to Face_None, which writes no expression." },
      { title: "Expressions mix together",
