        cause: "Write Defaults is OFF and the angry clip doesn't write the smile's BlendShapes, so the smile's values stay behind.",
        fix: "Write every expression BlendShape into every clip. Set the ones that expression doesn't use to 0." },
      { title: "The expression flickers or doesn't fully change",
